Substation SCADA — web-facing backup drop
==========================================

Do NOT rely on this directory. It is a temporary staging area left over
from the 2016 RTU/HMI migration and should have been deleted long ago.

Contents:
  notes.txt                operator handover notes
  hmi_backup_2016.tar.gz   snapshot of the operator HMI project

If you can read this from the public internet, the network segmentation
is already broken. That is, more or less, the whole point.
